<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank places $15 mln in repos.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank places $15 mln in repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Monday it placed $15 million in overnight reverse repos at 9.0 percent.</p>
<p>Call money rose to 5.7 percent from 5.6 percent at the close Friday.</p>
<p>The U.S. dollar rose to 0.99984 pesos from 0.99953 pesos Friday.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0668))</p>
